@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFDF8
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDF8
  BorderColor #C9B9A2
  ArrowColor #8A7A67
  FontColor #2B241B
  FontSize 12
}

state kStarting
state kStandby
state kCandidate
state kRecovering
state kCatchingUp
state kLeaderWarmup
state kServing

[*] --> kStarting
kStarting --> kStandby
kStandby --> kCandidate : 竞选
kCandidate --> kRecovering : 赢得竞选
kRecovering --> kCatchingUp : 从快照恢复
kCatchingUp --> kLeaderWarmup : replay oplog 追平
kLeaderWarmup --> kServing : 预热完成才开始服务
kServing --> kStandby : 失去领导权

note bottom of kRecovering
  kRecovering / kCatchingUp / kLeaderWarmup
  在角色映射里**仍算 standby**
  —— 赢得竞选 ≠ 可以服务
end note
@enduml
